cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these notebooks, please cite them as below."
title: "Lagos coastal subsidence from Sentinel-1 InSAR: ISCE2 multi-burst processing scripts"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Glory Kehinde
    family-names: Abayomi
    affiliation: "Institut national de la recherche scientifique (INRS)"
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks used to check HyP3 INSAR_GAMMA results for phase-unwrapping
  errors, order and process Sentinel-1 ISCE2 multi-burst interferograms over Lagos,
  Nigeria with MintPy, decompose ascending and descending velocities into vertical
  and east-west motion, and compare the results with Ohenhen and Shirzaei (2022).
keywords:
  - InSAR
  - Sentinel-1
  - MintPy
  - land subsidence
  - Lagos
